1791774598528430	claude-buildshapes	itc:AQ		item.create	bn-3vz	{"description":"Bob: get away from hammer -> F4 -> shift+click. Choose a stake item with a flag from the build menu, just left click to place the points, then E on the zone to change the settings; shift+click / ctrl+click become layout modifiers. Don't do it now.","kind":"task","labels":["buildshapes"],"parent":"bn-8qm","title":"Replace hammer -> F4 -> Shift+click with a build-menu stake item (flag on it): left click places points, E on the zone opens settings, Shift/Ctrl+click as layout modifiers","urgency":"punt"}	blake3:SqVPq3hBdHJB-DVVPo0FQ3wAnBUwBuMcAE-qeaMbhcw
