1791857863812648	claude-jarldom	itc:AQ		item.link	bn-2s4	{"link_type":"blocks","target":"bn-1xw"}	blake3:AWHddn9DXvI8rdd23FpYUarNgCA_DkcFl4tH-KnrOcw
1791857863823810	claude-jarldom	itc:AQ		item.create	bn-2r4x	{"description":"# Context & Background\nSpec 2.3 #24. Ways back: a Dimmed soul asks for a deed (one of their personal requests, #32 in J5, chosen to be doable); or the gothi holds a rite at Odin's shrine (offering cost; Gothi in World/Faith.cs); joining an expedition (J6) or fighting in a raid also counts (worth gain). The panel (Ui/VillagerPanel.cs) says why they're dimming and what would help.\n# Implementation Approach\n- Panel section: reason + options.\n- Rite: new gothi action at Odin's shrine with an offering cost from stockpile/treasury -> worth gain -> reset.\n- Deed: hook to the villager request system (#32) once it exists: force-generate a doable request for a Dimmed soul. Until then, rite + raid only.\n# Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] A Dimmed villager shows a request in their panel, and completing it clears the Dimming.\n- [ ] The gothi rite clears it; fighting in a raid clears it.\n# How This Serves Project Goals\nJ3 acceptance line 2; keeps the Dimming fair.\n","kind":"task","labels":["jarldom","next-saga","j3","p2"],"parent":"bn-3k3","size":"m","title":"J3 #24c: The Dimming way back - the soul asks for a doable deed, or a gothi rite at Odin's shrine, or expedition/raid; panel explains"}	blake3:kstHJh1rGWQ6rSC-0rQvZ4vDzE0x9zFsxh9YLD9ZTpY
