1791857864454473	claude-jarldom	itc:AQ		item.create	bn-1q4b	{"description":"# Context & Background\nSpec 2.3 #26. Lost souls already rise as draugr (memory: lost soul draugr; `jarldom fallen`, `unlose`).\n# Implementation Approach\nMap pin by key (pin add/remove by key exists; leaves player pins alone) at the draugr's position (update occasionally; draugr move, so keep keys small and find by own id, not ZDOID). On death: drop a new item JarldomRemains (prefab name forever) with custom data = soul id and display name \"<Name>'s remains\" (m_value 0, can't be sold).\n# Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Lost soul's draugr pinned with their name; killing it drops their named remains; pin removed.\n# How This Serves Project Goals\nTurns loss into a quest.\n","kind":"task","labels":["jarldom","next-saga","j3","p2"],"parent":"bn-3k3","size":"m","title":"J3 #26a: Lost souls marked - a lost soul's draugr shows on the map ('Ulf, who was lost'); killing it drops 'Ulf's remains'"}	blake3:cIu4duGsZO83w82BJNFvJkl22LaQBrQfWfChK0aW8us
